          "settings": {
            "question": "What should I include in my inquiry?",
            "answer": "<p>Tell us about your space, the look you are drawn to, any practical access details, and the week or event you are planning around. The form asks for your name, email, and phone number so the studio can follow up. You do not need a fully formed design before reaching out.</p>"
