            "answer": "<p>Once you submit the form, the studio can review your notes and follow up about feasibility, design scope, availability, and next steps. An inquiry is the beginning of a conversation—not a confirmed quote, order, or booking. Nothing is reserved simply because the form was sent.</p>"
